---
description: API hosts are composition roots — thin controllers, no business rules
globs: src/API/**/*.cs
alwaysApply: false
---

# API layer

- Controllers: bind request → MediatR → HTTP result. No domain invariants here.
- Register services in `Program.cs` (`AddApplication`, `AddPersistence`, JWT). Do not add packages or rewrite the host without approval.
- Keep exception → status mapping in middleware (RFC 7807).
- Request records live with the controller or as API models — not in Domain.
